      "text": "Paramaribo and dolphins at sunset"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "9b091e2297086c6ac8741a3d0476e05dc8db73d50f7fa09aefb005cb02b8c520",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw9pzpme-g1f7fnp0wz",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Start the day with a sightseeing tour of Paramaribo. You’ll see the wooden Cathedral of Saints Peter and Paul, several UNESCO World Heritage sites, Independence Square, Fort Zeelandia and the Palm Garden. The tour also includes a walk through local markets.\n\nAfter the tour, transfer to Leonsberg for a boat trip on the Suriname River in search of pink dolphins. Watch the sunset from the water, then return to your hotel.\n\nMeals: breakfast."
    },
